      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of the therapeutic efficacy of tiapride in various neurological disorders was carried out during the period October 1974 to May 1975. Good results were obtained in headaches following lumbar puncture and removal of CSF, and in agitated states, especially those associated with alcoholism."},
